{
  "changelog": "Initial release.\n\n- Provides optimized logistics route planning for both TSP (Traveling Salesman Problem) and VRP (Vehicle Routing Problem with capacity and time window constraints).\n- Supports nearest-neighbor plus 2-opt heuristic for TSP; greedy assignment and per-vehicle TSP for VRP.\n- Handles both Haversine (longitude/latitude) and Euclidean distance metrics.\n- Accepts real customer data via GeoJSON or generates synthetic (offline) datasets.\n- Outputs solution data in GeoJSON and JSON formats, including route details and cost summaries.\n- All processing is fully local, with no data upload required.",
